# The repo-root build context is used by logos-orchestrator/Dockerfile,
# logos-agent/Dockerfile, logos-agent/workspace/Dockerfile,
# agent-gateway/Dockerfile, rate-limit-gateway/Dockerfile and
# e2e/harness/nodesim/Dockerfile.
# Whitelist exactly what those Dockerfiles COPY so the context stays small
# and untracked local files (benchmarks, calibration data, .git, …) never
# get uploaded to the builder.
#
# A Dockerfile added here without its inputs whitelisted fails with
# "failed to compute cache key: … not found" — the path is simply absent from
# the context.
*
!db
!logos-orchestrator/pyproject.toml
# The orchestrator installs with `uv sync --locked`, so the lock is a build
# input rather than local churn.
!logos-orchestrator/uv.lock
!logos-orchestrator/src
!logos-orchestrator/tests
# Agent runner: the service package and the session-image entrypoints.
# Deliberately not the whole directory — no README, no tests in the image.
!logos-agent/pyproject.toml
!logos-agent/app
!logos-agent/workspace/run_session.py
!logos-agent/workspace/verify_checkout.py
!logos-agent/workspace/screenshot.js
# Compile caches are resolved at image build time for offline session checks.
!logos-webservice/pom.xml
!logos-webservice/src
!logos-ui/package.json
!logos-ui/package-lock.json
!logos-ui/src
!logos-ui/public
!logos-ui/angular.json
!logos-ui/tsconfig.json
!logos-ui/tsconfig.app.json
!logos-ui/tsconfig.spec.json
!logos-ui/postcss.config.mjs
!logos-ui/vitest-base.config.mts
# The E2E node simulator image: the real worker package plus the harness.
!logos-workernode/requirements.txt
!logos-workernode/logos_worker_node
!e2e/harness
# The session image installs the repository's own hook environments at build
# time, because a session has no network to install them with.
!.pre-commit-config.yaml
# The model gateway's nginx configuration, shipped in its image rather than
# bind-mounted: a deployment copies only the compose file to its VM.
!agent-gateway/nginx.conf
# The per-IP rate-limit gateway's nginx configuration and entrypoint, same
# reasoning as the agent gateway above.
!rate-limit-gateway/nginx.conf
!rate-limit-gateway/upstream.conf
!rate-limit-gateway/entrypoint.sh
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
